eedle appears in Chatterbox's hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_40","text":"Do you know what this is?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_41","text":"It's a device intended to induce corruption.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_42","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_43","text":"One prick from this, and you'll answer to the Raptures entirely.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_44","text":"Would you like to know a secret? You probably thought that once corruption occurs, your mind would be destroyed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_45","text":"But that's not true. In reality, your consciousness remains intact.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_46","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_47","text":"However, you have no control over what you say or do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_48","text":"It's like you're outside yourself looking in, unable to exert any influence over your own body.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_49","text":"And in the end, you die by your comrade's hands.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_50","text":"All throughout the entire process, you are painfully conscious of everything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_51","text":"Sounds like a miserable experience, does it not?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_52","text":"Answer my question, and I won't subject you to such a torturous fate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_53","text":"Urgh...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_54","text":"Agh! Your Highness...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_55","text":"Still mulling it over?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_56","text":"Then I'll change the terms of the deal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_57","text":"If you answer, I'll spare your life.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom1_05_e_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"talkative","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom1_05_e_58","text":"You can return to your friends and fight us once more or run away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"